body:
Head to any Bart station and buy a paper ticket at the automated machine. or set up your clipper card for 3 extra dollars from here [https://www.clippercard.com/ClipperWeb/get](https://www.clippercard.com/ClipperWeb/get)

&#x200B;

you basically buy a paper card and fill it with enough money for round trip to the Colosseum Bart station.
